Indicolite Armor is the planar armor set for [[Warrior|Warriors]]. It drops as part of [[Classic Planar Armor: Group 2|Group 2 Armor Sets]] in the [[Plane of Hate]] and [[Plane of Fear]]. The named target that always drops two pieces of this armor is [[Grandmaster R`Tal]] in the [[Plane of Hate]].

